###

### 10. Submit feedback - Missing subject (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "inquiry",
  "message": "This should fail because subject is missing."
