### 12. Submit feedback - Empty message (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "inquiry",
  "subject": "Test subject",
