### ============================================================================
### EDGE CASES
### ============================================================================

### 15. Submit feedback - Minimum valid message length (10 characters)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "inquiry",
  "subject": "Test",
  "message": "Ten chars!"
}

###

### 16. Submit feedback - Special characters in name
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "O'Brien-Smith, Jr.",
  "email": "obrien@example.com",
  "type": "inquiry",
  "subject": "Test with special characters",
  "message": "Testing special characters in name field."
}

###

### 17. Submit feedback - Unicode characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "José García",
  "email": "jose.garcia@example.com",
  "type": "feedback",
  "subject": "Feedback en español",
  "message": "¡Excelente plataforma! Me encanta usar iStudy para mis estudios. 你好世界 🎓📚"
}

###

### 18. Submit feedback - Type in uppercase (should work - case insensitive)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "FEEDBACK",
  "subject": "Testing uppercase type",
  "message": "This should work because type validation is case-insensitive."
}

###

### 19. Submit feedback - Type in mixed case (should work)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "FeedBack",
  "subject": "Testing mixed case type",
  "message": "This should work because type validation is case-insensitive."
}

###

### ============================================================================
### NOTES
### ============================================================================
# 
# Expected Behavior:
# - Valid submissions return 201 Created with success response
# - Invalid submissions return 400 Bad Request with error message
# - Email notifications are sent asynchronously (check logs)
# - Admin notification goes to support@istudy.ie
# - User confirmation goes to the submitted email address
# 
# Email Configuration:
# Make sure these properties are set in application.properties:
# - spring.mail.username (from email)
# - app.support.email (admin email)
# - spring.mail.host, port, password (SMTP settings)
# 
# Database:
# Run database_migration_create_feedback_table.sql before testing
# 
# Authentication:
# This endpoint works for both authenticated and anonymous users
# If user is authenticated, their user_id will be linked to the feedback
#